a body holding a request, with a length:
  request POST /form
  end of POST /form 35 bytes
  request GET /last
  end of GET /last 0 bytes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /formHTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /last
the same, chunked:
  request POST /form
  end of POST /form 35 bytes
  request GET /last
  end of GET /last 0 bytes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /formHTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /last
the body after the answer:
  request POST /form
  end of POST /form 35 bytes
  request GET /last
  end of GET /last 0 bytes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /formHTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /last
two at once:
  request GET /one
  end of GET /one 0 bytes
  request GET /last
  end of GET /last 0 bytes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /oneHTTP/1.1 200 OK | answer /last
